MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_001: Oh, my. Cai, you've really done it this time.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_002: You've got some world-class bedhead going on there.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_003: Come here—let me fix that for you.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_004: I'm too old for that, Mom. I can do it myself.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_005: Cai, no matter how old you are, you're still my child.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_006: I know... This is embarrassing!
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_007: Correct. It is embarrassing.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_008: Oh, Ninae! How are you?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_009: Hello, Aurora. I have already overstayed. Goodbye.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_010: Wait! Hold on!
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_011: There is a distressedness to you. Is it this distress\nthat drove you to me?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_012: About what happened back there... We're not\nnormally like that.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_013: Not like what? Supply details.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_014: J-just...my mom, fixing my hair.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_015: Is this what distressed you?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_016: Just don't tell anyone about that. Please.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_017: No one will know it from me.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_018: Oh. Thanks, Ninae! Thank goodness you're the\nonly one who saw that.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_019: Do not be thankful. Several others witnessed it.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_020: What?! Really?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_021: Aww, I didn't think anyone else was around.\nI'm ruined!
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_C_022: {SetColor=Gray}What a strange reaction. The spirits are constant\nwitnesses to me and everyone nearby.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_001: I'm so hungry. This is gonna be great.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_002: Yum! Mom makes the best lunches.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_003: What a lovingly packed lunch. Did Aurora prepare it?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_004: I see egg. I smell spices. And I sense a layer of\ndough around minced-meat filling.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_005: Oh, uh, yes. My mom makes it for me when I'm busy.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_006: I tell her there's no need, but she insists on making\nup for lost time.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_007: It's not easy to get even a single egg these days, but\nsomehow she always manages.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_008: {SetColor=Gray}If I hadn't killed my mother, she may have done the\nsame for me. But we will never know.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_009: I'm happy to share, if you want some. It's really good.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_010: But Aurora prepared this for you. I am someone else.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_011: I've got plenty, so don't be shy. Mom always goes\noverboard and makes way too much.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_012: Mm! Aurora's skill with food is divine.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_013: Is her gift natural, or acquired?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_014: She learned to cook when she and Pop and me\nstarted living together.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_015: At first she messed up a lot. She'd burn food, she'd\nlet pots boil over, stuff like that.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_016: Sometimes, we'd all sit together eating food that was\ntotally burned, and we'd just laugh. Happier days.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_017: A hard-won talent, then. The rarest of gifts.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_018: Yeah, I should follow her example... Uh, Ninae, is\nsomething wrong?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_019: This food is powerful.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_020: Huh? Does that mean you like it?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_021: Yes. I took a powerful liking to it.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_022: Ninae, you do have a unique way of expressing\nyourself, don't you?
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_023: Do I? Interesting.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_024: I'd love to get to know you better, Ninae. Let's eat\ntogether again sometime.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_025: I'll ask Mom if she'll pack some things you like too.
MID_SE_Kai_Nin_B_026: Thank you. I may not deserve her powerful\naffection...but I won't refuse it.